    {
      "text": "%pyspark\n\nconfluence_url \u003d \u0027https://blendata.atlassian.net/wiki\u0027\n\nchunk_size \u003d 1000\nchunk_overlap \u003d 100\nqdrant_url \u003d \u0027http://159.138.245.92:6333\u0027\nqdrant_grpc_url \u003d \u0027http://159.138.245.92:6334\u0027\ncollection_name \u003d \u0027blendata_confluence\u0027\nemb_field \u003d \u0027dense\u0027\ndense_model_name \u003d \"sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2\"\nsearch_model_name \u003d \"sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2\"\n\ndense_model \u003d SentenceTransformer(dense_model_name)",
