    {
      "text": "%pyspark\n\nloader \u003d ConfluenceLoader(\n    url\u003dconfluence_url,\n    username\u003dcredential[\u0027confluence_username\u0027],\n    api_key\u003dcredential[\u0027confluence_api_key\u0027]\n    )\n\ndocs \u003d loader.load(space_key\u003d\"BE1\", include_attachments\u003dFalse)",
